  "title": "SPAM Fries with Spicy Garlic Sriracha Dipping Sauce",
  "description": "Everyone's favorite luncheon meat, SPAM is transformed into delicious fries with a spicy garlic sriracha sauce!",
  "authors": [
    "The Gruntled Gourmand"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-04-09T02:50:15-04:00",
